30,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"It seems people are wasting an hour a day copying records, and misrouted deliveries are happening because of inconsistent addresses.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,May,,Our developers are tied up until Q3 and the coordination group is understaffed. We can't just add more tasks.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Customer plant networks are unreliable and visitor approval is a nightmare. Also, per-head licensing is a potential cost trap.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The capital budget is frozen, though we have some software allowance. Vendor queries are also being handled redundantly.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"Past rollouts that required everyone's daily input failed, but narrow tools for specific trades survived. Standardization often lacks owners.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Ryuji, if the capital budget is frozen, does that mean we can only afford software-based solutions?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,May,,"@Shunichi, if the network is that bad, any app relying on a live connection will fail immediately.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"Exactly. Any ""field"" solution needs to be very robust regarding offline access.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"Yes, Daisuke. We are limited to the recurring software allowance for now.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@May, if developers are busy, maybe we should look for something that doesn't require heavy custom coding?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,The data duplication issue is a real daily loss. It's not just a theory.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,May,,"I'm worried about who actually manages the tool. If the coordination group is empty, it'll just crash.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Ryuji, the redundant vendor queries suggest a data synchronization problem, similar to what Daisuke found.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Ryuji"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,I agree. The inefficiency is systemic. We need a solution that fits the current budget and doesn't add overhead.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"We should avoid anything that requires ""everyone"" to use it daily, or it will be dropped like the last ones.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
